@Wait WaitMode:1.8

[PrintTextModified Text:呀吼～我是泽渡可可哦～！<br>你们能看到我吗～？|#0201Adv05_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:喂，你在做什么啊……？|#0201Adv05_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:别随便进来啊！<br>我现在正在直播呢！|#0201Adv05_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:直播……？还有这种功能吗？|#0201Adv05_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1,ArmR4,ArmL2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:欸～，嗯～，哦～～|#0201Adv05_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:原～来如此啊～！这也太过分啦！<br>嗯嗯，有幕后黑手，我会变成怪物……<br>太糟糕了！！|#0201Adv05_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你在和谁说话啊……？|#0201Adv05_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:哈？和自己啊。|#0201Adv05_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和自己说话？你是在自言自语吗？<br>你该不会是个疯子吧？|#0201Adv05_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR4,ArmL2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:都说了别进来啊大小姐！<br>现在正到重要的地方呢！|#0201Adv05_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只要在直播中露脸，<br>就能和那边的我自己连接在一起。|#0201Adv05_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，这好像是只有在我魔女化进行到一定程度<br>才能使用的能力。|#0201Adv05_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在的我只能从那边的我那里<br>获得有限的信息。|#0201Adv05_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:？？？|#0201Adv05_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……虽然只能知道到我死为止的事，<br>不过我大概已经明白啦。|#0201Adv05_Coco010| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真是不可原谅啊。我居然会死。<br>在见到我推之前，我可不能死啊。|#0201Adv05_Coco011| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

