[PrintTextModified Text:喂，正在看我直播的家人们……<br>你们在看的吧？|#0201Adv05_Coco012| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你们那边的事我也看得到哦。|#0201Adv05_Coco013| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

